Senate proposal of amendment
H. 410
An act relating to the calculation of recidivism and other related
criminology measures.
The Senate proposes to the House to amend the bill in Sec. 1, 13 V.S.A.
chapter 233, in section 8121, in the fourth sentence, by striking out “clock for
calculating” and after the word “recidivism” by inserting “calculation”

